! REPRODUCER for a model limitation found 2026-11-16 by C22-6578 Problem
! 3.9 (decks/problem_3_9_*.strap; docs/NEXT.md, "C22-6578 CHAPTER 3"
! item 6): a VFL STORE whose field lies in the indicator register,
! word 11, changes nothing.
!
! C22-6578 printed pp.32-33, Problem 3.9, both methods:
!       L(BU, 3), $RLZ          '$RLZ, $RZ, $RGZ fetched
!       ST(BU, 3), $AL          '$AL, $AE, $AH stored
! The pocket reference card X22-6533-1, footnote c to word 11, makes
! only indicator bits 0-19 read-only; AL, AE and AH are bits 60, 61 and
! 62 (both as transcribed in docs/microarchitecture_plan.md A.10 and
! strap/opcodes.py; the card was not re-read in the ink for this deck).
! The model drops every ordinary store to word 11
! (bsv/StretchStorage.bsv, writeWord, addrIndicators: "SIMPLIFICATION
! ... only the 'poke via STORE' path is unavailable"), silently, so the
! example's whole purpose is lost.
!
! THE DECK: put 100 (binary) into $AL, $AE, $AH and read the three
! bits back with an ordinary VFL load.  V's leftmost bit is one, so
! L(BU, 3), V loads 100 = 4.  Nothing between the store and the
! reload sets a comparison indicator (p.59: AL, AE, AH are set "by the
! comparison operations").
!     R expected 0000000000000004   (by hand)
!
! FIXED 2026-11-16 (bsv/StretchStorage.bsv, writeWord(11) -> indStW,
! merged by commitIndicators).  Reference Manual printed p.37, right
! column, read in the ink: "Bit positions 0-19 of the indicator register
! can be read, but not loaded.  Any attempt to store into these positions
! has no effect.  Bit positions 20-63 may either be read or loaded. ...
! When an instruction calls for storing into any part of the indicator
! register, the result in bits 20-63 of the indicator register will be
! the same as if this operation had acted upon any other storage location
! whose initial contents were the same as those of the indicator register
! at the start of execution of the instruction.  The setting of any of the
! indicators 20-63 that would normally occur as part of the store
! operation is overridden by this result."
! Registered: R = 4, and word 11 = 0000000000000128 at the halt -- AL
! (60) from the store, MOP (55) and RGZ (58) from the last ST of 4.
! INJECTION 3, measured 2026-11-16 (writeWord(11) back to noAction), over
! the 28 location-8/indicator suite lines: FAILED this deck's checks
! (problem_3_vfl_store_to_indicators R = 0 and IND = 0000000000000140;
! repro_cm_indicator_bit IND = 0000000000000120), and the IND checks of
! four 3.9 decks: method1_less 0x20, method1_equal 0x2000000020,
! method1_greater 0x1000000020, method2_less 0x24.  Nothing else
! (method2_page_fault's IND, set by K alone, passes either way).
!
! OBSERVED ON THE MODEL BEFORE THE FIX, 2026-11-16, ASM=strap2: R = 0 (FAIL), PC=72
! (reached, PASS).  Indicator word 0000000000000140: bit 55, MOP, and
! bit 57, RZ -- the reload found three zero bits; AL never came on.
! R is reserved DR(N) so that it is a whole word.

START   L(BU, 3), V
        ST(BU, 3), $AL
        L(BU, 3), $AL
        ST(BU, 64), R
        BEW, $
R       DR(N), (1)
V       DD(BU, 64), 9223372036854775808
        END, START
